<title>USA: U.S. mortgage application volume fell in latest wk.</title>
<headline>U.S. mortgage application volume fell in latest wk.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of U.S. mortgage applications fell 1.6 percent in the week ended May 23, according to a Mortgage Bankers Association of America weekly survey.</p>
<p>Specifically, the volume of applications to refinance mortgages fell 2.2 percent in the latest survey week, while applications to purchase mortgages fell 1.4 percent.</p>
<p>The seasonally adjusted refinancing index fell 2.2 percent to 325.1 from 332.5 the previous week.</p>
<p>The purchase index fell 0.5 percent to 191.1 in the latest survey from 192.0 in the previous week.  </p>
